  tip He stands on Hunter Rise. Each donation takes sixty Wool, Silk or Mageweave from your bags: hand in what you carry, skip the rest.
  accept 7820 optional
  turnin 7820 optional
  accept 7821 optional
  turnin 7821 optional
  accept 7822 optional
  turnin 7822 optional

