  tip Bashana buys Morrowgrain grown from your Un'Goro Soil. Morrowgrain Research wants ten, and the Evergreen Pouch gives one try every ten minutes: take it only if you already have the grain.
  accept 3786 optional
  complete 3786 optional
  turnin 3786
  accept 3804 optional
  complete 3804 optional

